{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "6b16e28abe6f2c6e889dc9899cc782ff73175c97938fc762f0dd12fc4ae6dcb0", "ja": "オーバーマスター", "zh": "OVERMASTER", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "78e0ae1e602f8ea8ed0f9492b294a647de95dd4c7e6e16ac86d012330fc22b33", "ja": "美希、貴音、響のユニットがデビュー。\n3人の全国ツアーに帯同するバックダンサー\nのオーディションに参加した翼は、周囲を\n圧倒するダンスを披露するが、美希に否定\nされてしまう。", "zh": "美希、贵音和响组成的组合出道了。翼参加了随同3人的全国巡演的伴舞选拔，她展现出压倒周围人的舞蹈，却被美希否定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "18d1f256c5bd09f0ebe06069b0455db28cee3570e6e84a01b1e8b8a71be72ba5", "ja": "（あれは星井さん、四条さん、我那覇さんが\n765プロの新ユニットとして始動した頃のことです）", "zh": "（那是星井小姐、四条小姐和我那霸小姐以765事务所的新组合开始活动的时候）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "3649137c3a0a24511285e7d08d031cdc65392f7b91f6dfadd10299dc3452a13f", "ja": "（劇場では、先輩方の話題で持ちきりでした。\nそんなある日、プロデューサーがやってきて……）", "zh": "（剧场里满是前辈们的话题。\n就在那一天，制作人来到了这里……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "a576070eea428974569661aab15a654254e226aa44e739f766b3257e53d149a0", "ja": "ツアーのバックダンサー！？", "zh": "巡演的伴舞！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "a576070eea428974569661aab15a654254e226aa44e739f766b3257e53d149a0", "ja": "ツアーのバックダンサー！？", "zh": "巡演的伴舞！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "45c4d58066acfd36e7a65dc7e3ee1be74776986e2671ccbb67cfb41593b07f21", "ja": "せ、先輩方と全国ツアーに出られるってことですか！？", "zh": "也、也就是说，我能和前辈们一起参加全国巡演吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1005_406gsp", "source_sha256": "38420d20e185e9398eb0a5d8f887234b74e69eb5c4511ff9726ba667b1db43b1", "ja": "……待て待て、落ち着け。\nもちろん、全員出られるわけじゃないぞ。", "zh": "……等等，冷静点。\n当然不可能所有人都参加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1006_406gsp", "source_sha256": "2204cfb09c6c0d9d7c178956db11ad1a13a12976e04332ec1e123f547e0b7862", "ja": "メンバーはオーディションで決定する。審査は、響、\n貴音、美希のツアーメンバー3人が直接行うから……。", "zh": "成员将通过试镜来决定。评审将由响、贵音、美希的巡演成员3人亲自担任……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c2032ec5b0c3cb4c9420d589efb46a279614ec40389b6fb7b43f8458760b81a7", "ja": "美希先輩？\n美希先輩と一緒にライブできるの～！？", "zh": "美希前辈？\n要和美希前辈一起参加演唱会吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b8d8e31fa36ea3ade76b7b41bb6fb30de2b2d72461fcdff48fec7c2ac70a4f3", "ja": "はいはいはーいっ！\nわたしそれ、絶対やりたいでーっす！", "zh": "我我我——！  \n我绝对想做那个——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "caab24111ab859c2026b20186b7dada4291db47e79c656ab62b03e1fe227aaee", "ja": "プロデューサーさん！　私もやってみたい！", "zh": "制作人！我也想试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "467571e96940ac8c80073fbdf6006a104df93293e585718173b1cfd57cdc8982", "ja": "わ、私だって！", "zh": "我、我也想去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1011_406gsp", "source_sha256": "aded47b3f53f0763e69feca2df701a7e972b31c411d01e4891e89df146b4e5fe", "ja": "だから選ぶのは俺じゃないって言ってるだろ……。", "zh": "所以都说了，做选择的不是我啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "d78caf0a8c0866a489c6b7663ce62caa4ec4f4941584594fb261df5d611de624", "ja": "いい？　未来、翼も。コホン……。劇場を出て\n先輩方と同じステージに立つということは……。", "zh": "听好了，未来、翼。咳咳……走出剧场，和前辈们站在同一个舞台上，也就意味着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "b52c55939bbc9f2f7382dbfd0c1dc4a71b3288dcbe0f7e0da00232659c88e140", "ja": "アイドルとしてステップアップする最高の機会よ。\n絶対に逃せないわ。", "zh": "这是作为偶像更上一层楼的绝佳机会。\n绝对不能错过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "19dd4e25ea32cb8f557ac52d8d1f44bb4fdfd5daa284ae09e5389d34b6d92278", "ja": "んっとー。難しいことはよくわかんないけどー。\n美希先輩のバックやりたいから、ちゃんとするよー。", "zh": "唔——复杂的事情我也不太懂啦——\n不过我想给美希前辈伴舞，会好好努力的哦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "b54841b30df55d2ff1cd43206c8226314151c40f1358541f44c139bc731c4ca1", "ja": "翼って、美希ちゃんが好きなの？", "zh": "翼，你喜欢美希姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2ed0f831ce8fe5f82ed49f239a79121fad587d30d3392d108d1a4278ead15ed1", "ja": "うん！　お手本なの、\nわたしのハッピーライフの！", "zh": "嗯！美希前辈是我的榜样，也是我幸福生活的榜样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "742ec7d9d7718e43cf27ac81fc5a34ab9751b07af1c2193da7516dddeb04255c", "ja": "ハッピー……\nなに？", "zh": "幸福……\n是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fdd88b0526b4d2b35f540b6b0b500c039a684d6fcd68bfea1e3a1fbc88461983", "ja": "ハッピーライフ！　楽しくってモテモテで最高な人生の\nこと！　だって美希先輩っておしゃれで可愛くって、", "zh": "幸福生活！就是又开心、又受欢迎的最棒人生！因为美希前辈既时尚又可爱，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1e2bb90d086510f31e774cc65d09fcf8d8c9cea26fec9722051d647329577e10", "ja": "キツい練習とかしてなさそうなのに、ステージでは\n最高にキラキラだし、絶対毎日楽しいと思うんだー。", "zh": "明明看起来没怎么进行高强度训练，在舞台上却闪耀得不得了，我觉得这样的每一天肯定都很开心——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "921bb5e312c1077160ad741cb5e944bcb1bc8594794330380f9c8a12ba6aac54", "ja": "それが翼の夢なんだー。", "zh": "那就是翼的梦想呀——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0d24f9a722cc8cfdf3c4b5a63887b254487459a9253412fed00e6a5c9d2e6443", "ja": "うん♪", "zh": "嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1022_null", "source_sha256": "8a5dd85909808986f607f58851bc840cef31e8f42d352b9f693dc06ef754a0f7", "ja": "―バックダンサーオーディション当日―", "zh": "—伴舞试镜当天—", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "6da1476f829df14b626d38f5841c0e9f03688e6fba2f13905925c29976994712", "ja": "（オーディションは、参加者が一人ずつ、\n我那覇さんと四条さんの前で踊る形で進んでいきます）", "zh": "（试镜以参加者一个接一个地在我那霸小姐和四条小姐面前跳舞的形式进行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "76cdb58cecb642eebf4ce3c21058cac01fcba3ace248aee2eeaa038afa39e273", "ja": "静香ちゃんてばー\n結果出る前から落ち込んじゃ駄目だよ。", "zh": "静香真是的——\n结果出来之前就先消沉起来可不行哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "58830611ba85a4e43e7a045cde2017b0d3cec6966470e33ba759259972ac8959", "ja": "ってゆーか未来こそ反省しなさいよ！\n朝、練習したとこ全然覚えてなかったじゃない！", "zh": "话说回来，未来你才该好好反省吧！\n早上练习的内容你根本就没记住嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "7a0459ac1149289a704d41c012cfef3df8178a926f8bb03a13d52862066c0fd3", "ja": "翼は？\nもうすぐ順番だけど何か確認することとか……。", "zh": "翼呢？马上就到她了，有什么要确认的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e3e09835a602f4bd60380c7aea3aefcd80002b2ac90b6c4b770682b2329d879f", "ja": "……。\nん？　何か言った～？", "zh": "……。\n嗯？刚才说了什么吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "b483bbeb9a719762348b35a90d9a18f31d4cd5da1d3430f9e3f0a33f272b82b5", "ja": "いや、ごめんなさい。集中してた？", "zh": "不是，抱歉。你刚才在集中精神吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bbce36d8407a6e2b65ee8fef6e3505efc40c088b722f3b711e5ba39a9cc1f39d", "ja": "別に皆のダンス見てただけだよ～。", "zh": "没什么，只是在看大家跳舞啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1030_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "9b47f874e7abe6ecbcc78b81ac4d1612804f07b66c68206e0c228ee42505342a", "ja": "あふぅ。遅れてごめんなさいなのー。", "zh": "啊呜。对不起，迟到了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b411fe7da846ef12148c3a71161e9c42d17f250d939c88c4ceebcaceca5208f3", "ja": "美希せんぱーい！\n美希先輩、お仕事終わったんですか～？", "zh": "美希前辈——！美希前辈，工作结束了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "1fa43ed743cf7ff530983190d76da78bffbac339680464f239eb9feaba4d6308", "ja": "翼、久しぶりなの。ミキね、今日すっごく疲れてるから\nオーディション、パパッて終わらせるね。", "zh": "翼，好久不见。美希今天特别累，所以试镜很快就结束哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9bcbca093d2de084661c79d2ef907c56ffdc6fda04d35ea1858526b9d5d376fd", "ja": "それじゃあ……パパッと。\nもう踊っちゃっていいですか～？", "zh": "那么……速战速决。\n我可以直接开始跳了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "89195b9af4f0698b99a344dd9b23b389a1ccde85daff3f8394599a8eec861e5b", "ja": "ワンツー、スリー、フォー……。\n……っ♪", "zh": "一、二、三、四……。  \n……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "6ffb609c088d52fd9fbb5c6662ff9c31233f93259a4fa96dc85877c3cfbc8659", "ja": "（翼……。やっぱりすごい。\n私とは生まれ持った才能が違う……）", "zh": "（翼……果然厉害。\n和我这种天生的才能不一样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "3a2bd4deeab28a5900956659d54eceaf45fd1d26a95a14c5dcd1ba81ff135b4d", "ja": "（私だけじゃない。ここにいる全員……\n奪われる。あの瞳から、視線を逸らせない）", "zh": "（不只是我。这里的所有人……\n都被夺走了。无法从那双眼睛上移开视线）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bb4766a9aa7250e281b4df5e920d3551ce0667fcdbec2b6f15152bd74a351106", "ja": "美希せんぱ～い！　どうでした～？\nわたしのダンス。ツアー連れてってくれます～？", "zh": "美希前辈——！感觉怎么样～？\n我的舞跳得怎么样？你会带我一起去巡演吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1040_003mik", "source_sha256": "9f428cb6079777d55e822708703a01d96b20f3dcfe64ba764f29c7c9388cbd6f", "ja": "ミキね。\n翼はミキたちのダンサーに似合わないって思うな。", "zh": "我嘛，觉得翼不适合当我们的舞者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "555bf38e503144560e7499916868ca4ec3b543cd752755ab6aaef5f3949db938", "ja": "……ん？　ずいぶん騒がしいな。\n何かやってんだっけ？", "zh": "……嗯？挺吵闹的啊。\n是在做什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1043_406gsp", "source_sha256": "c2c22c99f424158f20942cd7b9f9c659b37907ecef1a42a038f609e0f6ac7c89", "ja": "オーディションだよ、例の全国ツアーの。俺としては\nジュリアにも参加して欲しかったんだけどな。", "zh": "是试镜啊，就是之前说的全国巡演。我本来还想让茱莉亚也参加来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "d1fd05d6f06d46c9a554b79d8d9cf18675c2e250d1b2b1eacf4cd6a71078ba4a", "ja": "馬鹿言え。あたしのダンスは、\nからきしなのは知ってるだろーが。", "zh": "少说傻话了。我跳舞有多差，你不是知道吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1045_406gsp", "source_sha256": "380783524a8530fe0158bcac0214536416b6039edbb9fbef23c1ee8bd320b042", "ja": "まだアイドルには抵抗があるか？", "zh": "你对偶像这个身份还是有抵触吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1046_050jul", "source_sha256": "3079c859ccc7554ff055261a510a1bd730ed3d4fbc0473e702b21f42182f8941", "ja": "いや、一度やると決めたんだ。やるからには\n手は抜かねえし、必要ならダンスだって踊ってやるさ。", "zh": "不，既然决定要做一次了，那我就绝对不会\n偷工减料。要是需要的话，我跳舞也照样奉陪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1047_050jul", "source_sha256": "a0e6bf01954274642352eb9d64bf8084279f4d36d1d5c3e94fd8cb87c9b1db0c", "ja": "そうじゃなくて……何つーか、", "zh": "不是这个意思……该怎么说呢，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_01_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "9d9a425df13423eaa4c15f32ff6c6fe680d3871147c0541d4b0734232f4b7090", "ja": "あたしにとってアイドルって、\n何なんだろーなと思ってね。", "zh": "对我来说，偶像究竟是……什么呢？我就这么想着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
